== Equipment ==
* [[gww:Nightstalker's Insignia|Nightstalker's Insignias]] or [[gww:Blessed Insignia|Blessed Insignias]].
* [[gww:Rune of Attunement|Runes of Attunement]].
* [[gww:Vampiric|Vampiric]] or [[gww:Zealous|Zealous]] Scythe [[gww:of Enchanting|of Enchanting]] with [[gww:Guided by Fate|"Guided by Fate"]].

== Usage ==
*Outside of an enemy group put all of your buffs up. Wait for the mob to reset, when they've all converged into a ball then death's charge in and spike.
*On patrols get your party in front of the mob, then death's charge in ahead of your party and spike.
*On single targets pull one by one with a bow if casters, pull martial enemies in large groups back to your party.

== Counters ==
* Anti Melee
* Enchant Removal
* Stripping Vow of Strength instead of your first optional.

